{"name":"Herbes","hex":"#a9a487","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Hierbas de Mallorca","blocks":[{"text":"Hierbas de Mallorca or Herbs de Majorca is a Mallorcan herbal liqueur of medicinal origin. A form of the generic Hierbas, Hierbas de Mallorca has a protected designation of origin and can only be made in Mallorca."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Hierbas.jpg/330px-Hierbas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hierbas_de_Mallorca","wikidata":"Q11925454"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Hierbas.jpg/500px-Hierbas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Hierbas.jpg/500px-Hierbas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHierbas.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}